{
  "id": 8834823454919,
  "title": "Personalized Deer Silhouettes Facing Each Other Comforter with Buck",
  "handle": "personalized-deer-silhouettes-facing-each-other-comforter-with-buck-080b2bfdf6-080b2bfdf6",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the cozy warmth and rustic charm of the great outdoors with the Jeminise Deer Hunting Couple Quilt. Beautifully designed for couples who share a passion for wildlife and adventure, this soft, lightweight quilt makes a thoughtful and personal gift for birthdays, anniversaries, holidays, or any special occasion. Designed with a double exposure silhouette of a buck and doe facing each other amidst a pine forest, it brings a touch of nature and a romantic partnership theme to your bedroom decor.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features customizable text options to add names, dates, or custom sayings to make your quilt truly one-of-a-kind.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from a breathable blend of 70% cotton and 30% polyester with a high-quality silk floss filling for comfortable, all-season warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor use, whether as a bed quilt, sofa throw, picnic mat, or cozy companion for camping trips.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simple to clean and maintain—machine washable in cold water, dries quickly, and fluffs up beautifully.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes as a single quilt with the option to select matching pillowcases during customization.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Hunting, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Deer Couple Hunting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
